	  -pdfa 1b appends a diagnostic entry to ::pdf4tcl::warnings instead
	  of silently violating ISO 19005-1 SS6.1.3. No exception raised.

	* src/prologue.tcl: ::pdf4tcl::warnings list variable added.
	  Accumulates non-fatal compliance warnings during PDF generation.

	* src/encrypt.tcl: MD5 backend chain (_InitMD5Backend, _MD5,
	  _MD5Init, _MD5Update, _MD5Final, _MD5PureTcl).
	  Priority: Tcllib md5 -> openssl -> pure-Tcl (RFC 1321).
	  AES-128 encryption now works on FIPS systems without Tcllib.
	  All four AES-128 MD5 call sites migrated to new _MD5 methods.

	* tests/new-0.9.4.22.test: 17 new tests covering XRef-Stream (7),
	  PDF version header (3), setAlpha warning (2), MD5 pure-Tcl (5).

