	  and PDF/A-2b fixes. Page 1 PDF version now dynamically shown.

	* demo/demo-alpha.tcl: section 8 added for -pdfa 1b setAlpha warning.

	* nogit/scripts/pdflab/pdflab2.tcl: _autoDetectPdfaFlavour proc added.
	  Reads pdfaid:part from XMP on file open (via pdfinfo -meta) and
	  sets verapdf_flavour automatically (1b/2b etc.).

	* tests/init.tcl: notRoot constraint added -- skips tests that depend
	  on Unix file permissions (fail when run as root).
	  hasTk constraint added -- skips tests that require Tk.

